    #      (specs/0026-grouping-and-line-styles.md, "P2: row and column
    #      styles"): the doc commit pattern "M3 part 4 P2: commit planning docs
    #      (the P1 rulings and verification)" and the subjects "M3 part 4 P2: ";
    #      the base is M3 part 4 P1's record commit, found as the doc commit's
